  证明: by cat_disch

Depends on / 依赖: cat_disch
-/
lemma fac {x y : C × D} (f : x ⟶ y) : f = (𝟙 x.1 ×ₘ f.2) ≫ (f.1 ×ₘ (𝟙 y.2)) := by cat_disch

/-- Any morphism in a product factors as a morphism whose right component is an identity
